    "body": "> I still don't understand why that is the case. Can you explain?\n\nBecause in the case that the IDREF is setup to go via a referencetarget, that custom element will be returned rather than the actual element within (e.g. a datalist). So the type would have to be HTMLElement to allow for that case.\n\nThe reason you want that behaviour is so you can actually determine there's a relationship setup. If we nulled in that case you wouldn't be able to determine that.",
