    "body": "Yeah, it seems reference target should impact `<label>.control` as well, for instance.\n\nAnother aspect not discussed in this thread is that a lot of this can be dynamic. You can setup a relationship before the custom element is initialized and has a reference target. Would it return null in that case until the custom element is initialized?",
